<title>USA: CCC seeks up to 20,550 T wheat for Yemen, Jordan.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks up to 20,550 T wheat for Yemen, Jordan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corporation (CCC) of the U.S. Agriculture Department is seeking offers for up to 20,550 tonnes of wheat for donation to Jordan and Yemen for April 1-25 shipment.</p>
<p>CCC seeks up to 9,600 tonnes of white wheat, maximum 13.5 percent moisture for Yemen and up to 10,950 tonnes number two or better hard red winter or hard red spring wheat for Jordan.</p>
<p>Offers are due by 1400 CST on March 18.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
